  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.LanceDBOASIS v2.0.3\n\nLanceDB OASIS Provider - embedded serverless vector database for OASIS holons and avatars via LanceDB Cloud REST API. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- Correct LanceDB Arrow merge transport and acknowledged save ownership (3114493)\n- Decode LanceDB Arrow queries and add bounded capability-aware CQL (eb0f50d)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Validate explicit LanceDB native table schema without implicit creation (0dae61c)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.LanceDBOASIS",
